{"id":281572724,"title":"7.Day9-day10","summary":"1.项目打包---基础打包和本地预览会生成一个build文件夹","content":"<p><strong>1.项目打包---基础打包和本地预览</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787150205080-4199d59d-80d5-4ce9-b55f-1f51df3e43d2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787150282160-63026709-3bf1-4772-b2c0-e372020a558d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>会生成一个build文件夹<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787150303098-4da9f66f-51c2-46c1-a6d2-4562ac281b56.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>2.打包优化--配置路由懒加载</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787150415107-307a3b5d-821e-43f9-9906-5d90d1778641.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787150480656-af5275dc-7b8d-4faf-8454-23c35d6495f7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787151128568-f1ba019d-c1c5-4dbc-925c-104ca8424b22.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>用哪个路由他才会动态的去加载出来<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787151169610-0f445e6c-7e04-4a23-a052-695b0e4e77d8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787151187069-5be326e1-0484-4c4c-86a6-5bf20a539f2b.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787151195183-a9e35745-f955-4d19-a53f-806504d89c2a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>3.打包优化--包体积可视化分析</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787151267781-c453958d-d294-4f3a-8031-aab96a826ea3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787151298519-988fe9cd-ccf8-495c-bd71-eb767d4f7779.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787151339685-ead787f1-1438-4412-8dd4-176e0e6b0b6e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787151393688-9f24fe9c-91b4-4d65-9934-38a935445693.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>然后我们就执行新的命令<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787151413877-69d7603e-74b3-415a-b14c-40fec86264e3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>4.打包优化--CDN配置</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787232950057-80d9a955-8ebb-453e-a1b7-2ee826bf9ec9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233114849-4eb373f4-4364-4c1d-8716-a991e294d6c1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233126320-9aeb47ed-99c9-4617-9b94-8278fc40a9ba.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233175542-fbe098d2-a450-4a8b-a570-6ed931da3a81.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>5.useReducer</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233264311-24e17301-036a-4c95-9a0e-4370a6624fff.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233334962-bbffd1d8-e910-4467-a3ab-8b6117dd00a7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233479095-5e1ee72f-60db-454c-8201-d4e4a92e9e54.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233662765-b2a91bc1-bec0-4207-8921-54212eb01719.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>没有问题<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233670437-1742d81b-ac07-49c9-abc3-ffba944dcc79.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233768357-c2259bc3-520c-414e-8e27-3466b2ddde68.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233802352-eef6ee98-4a17-4ce4-8bdb-fe98ac9a17d5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233862541-3233e153-162a-4144-8b3a-ed07baa5a855.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>6.useMemo</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233931331-44567a56-a55b-469c-a550-1ae995dec529.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787233961171-3d7cfda5-13d4-4ce7-abd0-9eea1f4089a8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787235554352-e56fe319-11c5-4d63-95af-71fc092fd9b9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>count2怎么变化都不会影响到我<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787235586348-4a6721b8-a13a-4cb3-86af-d9de950be9e6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们的计算比较密集也是苦于使用的</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787235665289-7a58b23d-3c79-4ba0-af1b-591a75689f0b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>7.React.memo-基础使用</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787235742695-d4885cc9-97f9-4478-9424-ee9f001285d3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787235786055-524aca28-a4b3-489d-a3cb-b26815b90bf7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236195196-820318b4-4872-408a-856e-b0ded4d575e3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>不会再打印了，父组件会重新渲染，但是子组件不会在控制台打印了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236215610-6a239ee9-54ad-4b7e-adf2-6305510963c8.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236270520-10d1ff5d-77d5-4adf-9acd-02ff5013200f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>8.React.memo--props比较机制</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236363383-eea50c50-ac32-4ca8-97b1-a7f95914e969.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236470592-0bae14df-b5fa-425f-b80d-f0398c71fce2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236480975-881f467f-d999-4f17-9c53-3667ddf9397a.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236561627-d9ed8f5a-5336-44a0-a3d4-81c551f5c5ca.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数组的地址会发生变化<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236592418-dd2a7642-8167-4cc2-b084-1c0ab04803c8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236772516-b2b8a418-26bb-4664-b30e-90ccd8797d73.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>不会发生变化<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236739094-68ef68e3-400c-49a7-96e7-24bcd32c0124.png\" alt=\"\">子组件不会重新渲染</p>\n<p><strong>9.useCallback</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236859652-2a82fe24-3c19-41e8-88ad-b4cbcca57bf0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们的依赖项空的话我们就缓存一次<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236899363-08c318a2-e6d6-4065-9212-1072b28efc6a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787236997624-cafb70f1-a77e-4fc4-aee4-2868763e6bbb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>父组件的数据还是会更新的，证明他还是在渲染的，子组件没有渲染，他被缓存了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787237019582-2b4c0719-6bd7-4ede-9638-3c1acb01ae34.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>10.React-forwardRef</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787237099085-d97f04ad-d1f4-4a53-88e6-aaa0e84f121a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787241675846-7d9eec61-a7fd-471d-b85f-4f75826f491b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>如果我们想要在父组件去利用ref去拿子组件的DOM元素的话，我们就这么来写。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787241830031-75be5abb-3587-4892-99fc-fa812ab1c834.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>11.uselnperativeHandle</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787241950602-d572e00c-6984-48ee-86f5-cf50d25d0109.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787241971086-22dba99f-4f46-41c5-9614-3b4fcab6d946.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787242137357-a3a9d7f1-431c-4735-ab90-bef80ded016c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787242168188-c7ce1692-c679-47dc-8ee6-ad3d57fcbb67.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>点击就可以聚焦了<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787242180580-20864f2d-1e86-4fbe-ba2a-3275da259f26.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>12.Class类组件--基础结构</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787315779339-57c2c0af-4473-4e7d-9782-6b7775e64b3d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316078061-312be0ce-5176-46c7-a888-28f37e16e738.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316158075-68b24330-3384-4608-ad9f-33ba28d3f590.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316169298-7e9eba47-e6c9-4648-ade1-2c0851db2c15.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>13.类组件生命周期函数</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316226626-53faccdd-4638-42a6-996a-a67f4de9cbb8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316292011-cd249529-d5c9-4bb0-ae2a-36521a6e08c8.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316299238-3c144cd2-f3ee-4141-bd75-188fb8399d5f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316365119-19944986-1a4a-4b7c-be22-5d60fc6c90ad.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316377420-60529745-f6fb-4377-b4db-74ab5972b277.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们多加一个定时器<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316414992-830e93d1-5640-4d6d-9e66-6f168376b6f4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316423691-984cc9fc-dd40-494a-a399-cbc6291016ce.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们销毁组件后，定时器还在运行<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316442172-4c13ef77-7194-4262-a124-77394b8430ce.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316477358-ba19cbb4-b499-47ef-b7b6-f1dff1fed578.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这样之后我们的定时器也就清理了。</p>\n<p><strong>14.类组件是组件通信说明</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316533847-6cd51f46-9bc9-4bc4-93e5-73a3ed628dfe.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316723347-3562238a-c9cf-4398-8eef-6e9ca036faec.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316731522-4315f734-8ed1-4abc-8f0c-aa9408cd71e4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316817772-587ecf2c-6b84-4f8d-8a7f-00db4726594a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316831524-8e837e10-8eed-452e-9f30-50eeddba6eea.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316867853-defadbc0-0353-4922-9f82-73e3bd1680b0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>15.zustand--基础用法</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316909977-1a8633d9-c20e-4d37-a2df-e3600dd883fc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316963711-e6b496a7-50e7-41de-a953-1c390bf9d6da.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们要先安装包<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787316976157-460465fc-cf39-4d7a-ac1f-786c844f5bfd.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787317163909-2b7b5fa9-6ea1-4308-96d4-d25483121be4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787317533820-60736365-ef0d-4127-a652-ada10a43839b.png\" alt=\"\">点击按钮会增加</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787317679656-cf26100f-6ade-4b20-96b8-2faf692ed985.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787317697188-a71493d7-51cd-45b9-a462-3756f30bb4f2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>16.zustand--异步支持</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787317788742-d90f207c-0d9c-4610-aff0-5abe54225811.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787317984598-fd2c1041-025e-48e8-bdac-d401bbca7436.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787318014526-75849346-25d2-4d95-8ca7-026dc7f02720.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787318023921-bb623fd3-cfb5-4fc0-b6ca-fd3311a97128.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><strong>17.zustand--切片模式</strong></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787384960530-eb609ced-7231-442c-a098-25b31dedfae5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787384996236-443af04d-2175-4c29-9edd-6cd6266f59da.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385013768-0e1ec012-8403-476b-9405-1223c1e81e63.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385340280-d97eafc0-af49-43d9-985f-821819e91f4b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1787385150831-b68e9742-83c9-4211-b1c3-9effb5147096.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":82407692,"category":{"id"